 36MG c  With the identification of g.s. and first 2+ state as intruder         
 36MG2c  levels (2007Ga34), this nuclide has been characterized as situated in  
 36MG3c  the so called 'island of inversion'.                                   
 36MG c  1989Gu03: {+181}Ta({+48}Ca,X) E=55 MeV/nucleon, GANIL.                 
 36MG2c  Particle stability of {+36}Mg first established.                       
 36MG c  1999YoZW: {+9}Be,{+181}Ta({+48}Ca,X) E=70 MeV/nucleon, RIKEN.          
 36MG2c  Measured half-life, %|b{+-}n, very preliminary results.                
