 36MG2c  {+48}Ca beam with {+9}Be target, time-of-flight and energy loss        
 36MG3c  methods to identify fragments, LISE-3 spectrometer at GANIL.           
 36MG4c  Measured isotopic half-life                                            
 36MG c  2007Ta15: {+9}Be,W({+48}Ca,X), measured production cross section       
 36MG c  2007Ga34: {+9}Be({+38}Si,X|g), established intruder character          
