 36MG c  {+36}Na is experimentally found (2002Lu09,2002No11) to be particle     
 36MG2c  unstable, thus it does not decay by |b{+-} to {+36}Mg.                 
 36MG c  {+37}Na nuclide is known (2004Lu19,2003Lu11,2002Lu09,2002Lu19,2002No11)
 36MG2c  to be particle stable, but no experimental information is available    
 36MG3c  for b{+-} delayed neutron decay to {+36}Mg.                            
